        "content": "<!-- page 1: blocked by provider content filter; transcription unavailable -->\n\n---\n\nThank you for sharing page 2 of 3 of this OIML Certificate. Here's a summary of the key information on this page:\n\n## Certificate Details\n- **OIML Certificate No.:** R76/2006-A-DK2-2023.07\n- **Issuing Authority:** FORCE Certification A/S\n- **Date of Issue:** 24 October 2023\n- **Signed by:** Jens Hovgård Jensen, Certification Manager (digitally signed)\n\n## Key Contents\n\n**Scope Statement:** The certificate relates only to metrological and technical characteristics of the measuring instrument type covered by the relevant OIML Recommendation — it does not bestow any legal international approval.\n\n**Associated Reports:**\n| Report Type | Number | Date | Pages |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Type examination report | 122-29322.10 | 30 March 2023 | 119 pages |\n| Type evaluation report | 122-29322.90.20 | 04 September 2023 | 27 pages |\n\n**Technical Documentation:** Documentation file no. 122-29322\n\n**Certificate History:**\n| Revision No. | Date | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| Initial version | 24 October 2023 | – |\n\n**Important Note:** Partial quotation of the certificate and associated OIML type evaluation reports is not permitted (except for the certificate's reference number and issuing Member State), although either may be reproduced in full.\n\nIs there anything specific you'd like to know about this certificate, or would you like me to help with something related to it?\n\n---\n\nThank you for sharing page 3 of the OIML certificate. Here's a summary of the **Descriptive Annex** for **OIML Certificate No. R76/2006-A-DK2-2023.07**:\n\n## Characteristics\n| Parameter | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| **Type** | ADW-E / ADW-C / AXM / AGS / VGS |\n| **Accuracy Class** | III and IIII |\n| **Weighing ranges** | Single-interval, multi-interval or multi-range |\n| **Maximum capacity (Max)** | 0.3 kg to 30 kg |\n| **Minimum capacity (Min)** | 20 × e |\n| **Max verification scale intervals (n)** | ≤6000 (single interval); ≤2×5000 (multi-interval/multi-range) |\n| **Verification scale interval (e)** | ≥0.05 g |\n| **Maximum tare effect** | −Max |\n| **Operating temperature range** | −10 °C / +40 °C |\n| **Power supply** | 12VDC external (100–240VAC 50/60 Hz) or 6VDC rechargeable battery |\n\n## Software Identification\n| Model Name | Software ID |\n|------------|-------------|\n| AXM & ADW-C | CE033 |\n| ADW-E | CE031 and CE032 |\n| AGS & VGS | CE034 |\n\n## Permitted Devices\n- Initial zero setting (≤20% Max), semi-automatic zero setting (≤4% Max), zero tracking (≤4% Max)\n- Semi-automatic and automatic subtractive tare devices\n- Printing, totalization, and unit toggling devices (g and kg only)\n- Sealed gravity compensation device\n- Stable equilibrium, Zero, and Net indicators\n\n## Interfaces\n- **RS232** — the interface does not have to be secured\n\nIs there anything specific you'd like me to explain or help you with regarding this certificate — for example, verifying a product's compliance, understanding the technical specifications, or comparing it against requirements?"
